骼、毒性</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BB%BA%E7%AF%89%E5%AE%B6.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BB%BA%E7%AF%89%E5%AE%B6.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>建筑学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：城市、建筑家、地点</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%97%85%E4%BA%BA.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%97%85%E4%BA%BA.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>旅行家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：时空、未来、超维度、地图、门径</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B4%A9%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A3%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B4%A9%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A3%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>崩坏的契机</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上、包含K级情景标签的SCP文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%96%E3%83%A9%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%96%E3%83%A9%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>另一个你</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>连续5次被自己解除编辑锁定</strong></span></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <blockquote> <p>所以终于咕……啊不是，肝出来了，大家好吖（#^·^#）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5934437&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="Sirius Dawn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5934437)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" >Sirius Dawn</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>被催了无数次才发人事的天狼是屑啦<span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><em>西北望，射天狼</em></span> ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/diamond-apple" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5190582&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="Diamond_Apple" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5190582)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/diamond-apple" >Diamond_Apple</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>西北望，射天狼！（高声尖叫）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="Chris Evertworth" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" >Chris Evertworth</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>天狼星？那么也可以指路咯！！！（瞻仰））——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krampus-of-error" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6050311&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="Krampus of Error" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6050311)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krampus-of-error" >Krampus of Error</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>来打酱油——顺便祝贺天狼星喜提人事——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mo-ring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3606007&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="Mo-ring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3606007)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mo-ring" >Mo-ring</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>别人的作者页.html——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5150580&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="MrPasserby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5150580)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" >MrPasserby</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>跳段街舞 ጿ ኈ ቼ ዽ ጿ ኈ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3453246&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="rorrErD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3453246)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" >rorrErD</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>迟到的祝贺，恭喜！<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5992128&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="Swred" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5992128)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" >Swred</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>贴贴天狼前辈www——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="YUANNN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" >YUANNN</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>到此一游~ <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>&lt;。<span class="ruby">+++++<span class="rt"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">/////////</span></span></span>《——<span class="error-inline"><em>LonelyFishbone</em> 不匹配任何一个现有的用户名</span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>天狼星发电站又双叒叕被我炸了，不过我删稿快，阻止了危机，你得好好感谢我（doge）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maybe-abs" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5540157&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="Maybe-ABS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5540157)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maybe-abs" >Maybe-ABS</a></span></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <div class="pseudo-tags"> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85#pages">作者</a></li> <li>夜空中最亮的星</li> <li>黄袍的国丈</li> <li>北风的狼王</li> <li>西北望，射天狼</li> <li>挽长弓兮射天狼</li> <li>必须诛国贼，先要射天狼</li> <li>只识弯弓射天狼</li> <li>流星一条射天狼</li> </ul> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5934437&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605963986" alt="Sirius Dawn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5934437)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" >Sirius Dawn</a></span></p> 
